item.text:
No score. The 2022 Chapter 3B record is mixed: there is real evidence of recurring repression, selective violence, and weak accountability, alongside narrower evidence of central rescue/protection and some restraint in the Northeast. Most of the negative record is state-level or institutional rather than a single direct Modi order, so attribution is partial and has to be stated carefully.

